<div class="bg-white px-5 py-5">

  {# About this design system #}
  <div class="mb-5">
    <h1 class="fw-bold mb-4">About The Right Up Design System</h1>
    <p>The component library behind The Right Up's editorial and media experience: reusable UI blocks for articles, media, and navigation, built once and used consistently across every page.</p>
    <p class="opacity-75">Under the hood, this theme is built on <a href="https://getbootstrap.com/">Bootstrap 5</a> and Drupal Single Directory Components (SDC), generated from Varbase's Vartheme BS5 Rightup starterkit.</p>
  </div>

  {# How to use #}
  <div class="mb-5">
    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">How This Design System Is Organized</h2>

    <div class="mb-4">
      <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">What this gives the team</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>A single source of truth for every UI component, browsable here in Storybook.</li>
        <li>Components built with Single Directory Components (SDC) so markup, styles, and behaviour ship together.</li>
        <li>Consistent editorial building blocks &mdash; cards, media, navigation &mdash; reused across all page types.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-light p-4">
      <p class="mb-0 opacity-75">Browse the Foundation section for colors, typography, icons and logos, and the component groups (Atoms, Molecules, Organisms) for the full UI library.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# Developer resources #}
